Hello hunters!

We have received reports of an issue that is affecting the use of callers since our latest PC patch, 1.25. We are aware of the issue and are working on a hotfix that will be available tomorrow, this will restore full functionality to callers. Thank you for your patience and feedback.

// theHunter: Call of the Wild Team
